print("AUC:", auc)
print("Log Loss:", loss)


FINAL CONCLUSION:

Credit card fraud detection is a highly imbalanced classification problem because fraudulent transactions are much less common than normal transactions. ROC-AUC, Precision-Recall curves, and Log Loss provide more useful information than accuracy alone when evaluating a model on such data.
